  "subject_1_left": {
    "description": "beautiful young woman in her early 20s, fit curvy athletic build with toned glutes and legs, long wavy brown or blonde pigtails hair styled in high ponytail with loose strands, fair tanned smooth skin with healthy glow",
    "clothing": "{argument name="left top color" default="bright yellow"} long-sleeve crop top with thumb holes and subtle sheen, matching high-waisted seamless short scrunch-butt light green leggings with 'KEOR' logo on waistband, pink puma athletic shoes",
    "details": "confident pose with hand on hip and slight smile, hair naturally tousled, relaxed athletic stance"
  },
  "subject_2_right": {
