    "clothing": "light purple halter-style sports bra with thin straps, matching high-waisted seamless short scrunch-butt white leggings, white nike gym shoes",
    "details": "playful confident pose with hand on hip and subtle expression in mirror reflection, hair with natural volume"
  },
  "environment": {
    "foreground": "dark rubberized gym floor with subtle texture ruined by glowing fungal growths",
